  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "國際商業溝通與談判",
    "sub_ename": "INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS COMMUNICATION AND NEGOTIATION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將 介紹溝通協商的概念、原則及要領，及優勢談判策略與技巧 。 先判 斷會發生衝突的情境、再了解談判的基本型態，透過談判的策略性思維，排定議題優先順序，最後蒐集資訊轉化成談判籌碼。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will introduce the concepts, teach principles and essentials of communication and negotiation, and the advantage of negotiation strategies and skills. Firstly, judge the conflict situations and understand the basic type of negotiation. Through the strategic thinking of negotiation, decide the priority of the issue, and the information collection will become the bargaining chip finally.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
