    "tpa_score_new": null,
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": null,
    "course_pol_en": "Description of scoring rules:1. Attendance: Consistent attendance, including punctuality, is paramount.2. Classroom Interaction: Active participation in the class discussions is crucial for this course.3. Group Work: Effective collaboration and constructive participation during group activities and presentations are essential.4. Presentation Etiquette: Avoid reading from cell phones during presentations.5. Preparedness: Come to class prepared with assigned readings and materials, demonstrating your commitment to learning.6.Contribution Quality: Strive for meaningful and insightful input in discussions and group work, emphasizing quality over quantity.",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": null,
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>Academic integrity encompasses various aspects: 1. Active class participation, engaging with respect and original ideas. 2. Upholding originality in assignments and discussions, avoiding plagiarism. 3. Consistent attendance, valuing the learning process by attending regularly. 4. Punctuality, arriving on time to honor commitments and maximize learning opportunities. 5. Preparedness, thoroughly reading assigned cases beforehand to contribute meaningfully to class discussions, demonstrating dedication to academic excellence.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
